DSP_Abus_sign_bit_alert  
U_adder_top/U_flicker/render/split_U0/prepare_geometry_U0/flicker_render_picud_U10/flicker_render_pipeline_ap_faddfsub_6_full_dsp_32_u/U0/i_synth/ADDSUB_OP.ADDSUB/SPEED_OP.DSP.OP/DSP48E1_BODY.ALIGN_ADD/DSP2/DSP: When using the PreAdder and USE_DPORT is TRUE, the A operand should be restricted to 24 bit two's complement (and sign extended) to avoid over/underflow in the pre-add stage.
